+# Code owners for Reclo.
+#
+# GitHub asks the owners of every file a pull request changes for a review, and the ruleset for
+# `main` (.github/rulesets/main.json) requires a code owner to approve before the merge.
+#
+# - The LAST matching pattern wins, so general patterns come first and specific ones after.
+# - Every owner needs write access to the repository, or GitHub ignores that owner.
+# - Every path has two owners: an author cannot approve their own pull request, so a path with
+#   one owner would block that owner's own changes.
+# - GitHub reads this file from the base branch of a pull request, so it takes effect once it is
+#   on `main`.
+
+# Default owners for anything not matched below.
+*                         @avaz-io @BahadurNUU
+
+# Backend (Express + Prisma)
+/apps/api/                @BahadurNUU @nozimjonfribble
+/apps/api/prisma/         @nozimjonfribble @dilnuraliqulov
+/apps/api/src/email/      @AlijonTursunboyev @BahadurNUU
+
+# Frontend (React + shadcn/ui)
+/apps/web/                @BahadurNUU @dilnuraliqulov
+/apps/web/src/i18n/       @dilnuraliqulov @nozimjonfribble
+
+# Zod schemas shared by web and api
+/packages/shared/         @BahadurNUU @dilnuraliqulov
+
+# Design docs
+/docs/                    @BahadurNUU @nozimjonfribble
+
+# CI, rulesets, templates and local infrastructure
+/.github/                 @avaz-io @BahadurNUU
+/docs/ci.md               @avaz-io @BahadurNUU
+/docker-compose.yml       @avaz-io @BahadurNUU
+/pnpm-workspace.yaml      @avaz-io @BahadurNUU
+/.nvmrc                   @avaz-io @BahadurNUU
